/**
 * VLM Service — Vision Language Model document extraction via vLLM (Qwen3)
 *
 * Calls the vLLM OpenAI-compatible endpoint with document images/PDFs
 * to extract structured accounting data using Qwen3-VL.
 *
 * Environment:
